# NOTE: the release keystore and its credentials ARE committed deliberately
# (android/key.properties + android/app/shuro-release.jks) so CI builds and
# local builds produce identically-signed, update-compatible APKs. If this
# repository is ever made public, rotate the key first (see README — Release
# signing).

